@@ -34,3 +34,21 @@ This proves the Builder/Theme archives are repeatable, have the required top-lev
 ## Integration checks
 
 The Connected staging/production Docker matrix is preserved on `bp/connected-v1-checkpoint` and is not an active release gate. A new single-site Pagecraft Theme matrix will be added with native package import, page ownership, menus, media, editor, fallback rendering, and uninstall-retention coverage under Issue #11.
+
+## Native document and accessibility regressions
+
+`tests/document-json.php` runs in the standard lint track. It verifies object-map repair across
+page trees, globals, saved blocks, components, variants, collections, and shared style tokens,
+including edits after associative JSON round trips. Genuine lists and generic canonical JSON
+semantics remain unchanged.
+
+On an isolated WordPress installation with this Builder checkout installed, run:
+
+```bash
+wp eval-file tests/wordpress-accessibility.php
+```
+
+This uses real WordPress KSES to verify native menu names, control relationships, live form
+status, and tab semantics while rejecting inline event handlers. Browser QA must additionally
+exercise the initial editor bootstrap, responsive inspector changes, reset-to-defaults,
+save/reopen, and frontend keyboard navigation; REST-only checks cannot cover the bootstrap.
